Included in this archive are the programming docs for DLG Pro version 1.1.
These cannot be used to create DLG 1.0 programs.  They are freely
distributable and should be made available to anyone that wishes to use
them.

If you have any questions or concerns, please contact our main support
site at (619) 549-7742 FidoNet 1:202/720, or from the internet you can
email us at jeff_grimmett@elric.maximumaccess.com.  You can also find our
web page on http://www.ald.net/dlg.

